  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://aidstream.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/documents/Private-sector-FINAL-20240628010649.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for promoting sexual and reproductive health and rights for employees in private companies</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnerships with employer organisations in Kenya and Uganda contributed to improved understanding among their members of the benefits of supporting their employees&#x2019; sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR). Since 2018, the partnerships with the employers&#x2019; organisations have made it possible to reach approx. 17.000 employees in private companies with sexual and reproduction health services and with information about their rights.</narrative>
   </description>
